    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1140870/extras/b3e3976009913aae62b9cd908e276645.poster.avif?t=1634983109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1140870/extras/b3e3976009913aae62b9cd908e276645.webm?t=1634983109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1140870/extras/b3e3976009913aae62b9cd908e276645.mp4?t=1634983109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>An hommage to classic arcade games from the 90s , adapted to the olympic sport of rugby sevens !<br><br>Experience Tackles, Rucks, Illegal Tackles <br>Make your way to the score lines and score many tries!<br><br>-up to 4 concurrent players (need joysticks)<br>-16 teams<br>-International Competions <br><br>The rules are the rugby seven rules, (i.e you can only pass backwards).<br><u>The only difference is that in the game you can tackle players without ball :)</u><br><br><strong>For a better experience, it's recommended to play with joysticks.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1140870/extras/b3e3976009913aae62b9cd908e276645.poster.avif?t=1634983109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1140870/extras/b3e3976009913aae62b9cd908e276645.webm?t=1634983109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1140870/extras/b3e3976009913aae62b9cd908e276645.mp4?t=1634983109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>An hommage to classic arcade games from the 90s , adapted to the olympic sport of rugby sevens !<br><br>Experience Tackles, Rucks, Illegal Tackles <br>Make your way to the score lines and score many tries!<br><br>-up to 4 concurrent players (need joysticks)<br>-16 teams<br>-International Competions <br><br>The rules are the rugby seven rules, (i.e you can only pass backwards).<br><u>The only difference is that in the game you can tackle players without ball :)</u><br><br><strong>For a better experience, it's recommended to play with joysticks.</strong>",
